OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Jackdaw gas field
OL,4,Aset to be approved in weeks, sources
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government is set to give the
OL,8,Fgo-ahead for a controversial new gas
OL,9,Ffield off the coast of Aberdeen, the
OL,10,FBBC understands.
OL,12,FApproval for the Jackdaw project could
OL,13,Fcome as soon as mid-September, just
OL,14,Fbefore Parliament breaks for party
OL,15,Fconference season, according to
OL,16,Fgovernment and industry sources.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
