OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Jackdaw gas field
OL,4,Aset to be approved in weeks, sources
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe gas field was approved by the
OL,8,Fformer Conservative government in 2022
OL,9,Fbut was delayed by a legal ruling from
OL,10,Fa Scottish court, after environmental
OL,11,Fgroups successfully argued that consent
OL,12,Fwas given without fully considering the
OL,13,Fclimate impact.
OL,15,FJackdaw's owner says it will account
OL,16,Ffor about 6% of UK gas supply while
OL,17,Fenvironmental groups say it will
OL,18,Fprovide only 2% of UK gas demand.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
